OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appearing in court as
OL,4,Aher lawyer pushes for murder case to be
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS mother Lindsay Clancy has appeared
OL,8,Fin court for the first time since her
OL,9,Ftrial fell apart, with lawyers on both
OL,10,Fsides arguing how to proceed with the
OL,11,Fcase
OL,13,FHer defence argued that the judge
OL,14,Fshould use his power to declare her not
OL,15,Fguilty. "Where's the evidence that she
OL,16,Fdid this?" he asks the court
OL,18,FProsecutors say the state "met its
OL,19,Fburden" in proving Clancy's guilt - 12
OL,20,Fjurors failed to reach a verdict during
OL,21,Fthe trial
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
